  description: '"Witchcrafter Madame Verre" + 2 Spellcaster monsters

    If this
    card is Fusion Summoned: You can Special Summon up to 3 Level 7 or lower "Witchcrafter"
    monsters with different Attributes from each other from your hand and/or Deck,
    also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn,
    except Fusion Monsters. During your End Phase, if this card is in your GY: You
    can reveal 1 Spell in your hand; Special Summon this card in Defense Position.
    You can only use each effect of "Witchcrafter Madame Rilliona" once per turn.'
